#. y4:last_reviewer=Karu

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "49\t109"
msgid "The answer's no."
msgstr "Me niego."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "116\t176"
msgid "Why not!?"
msgstr "¡¿Por qué no?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "179\t285"
msgid "I'm not sure what got you tossed in prison..."
msgstr "No tengo ni idea de como terminaste en prisión..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "286\t421"
msgid "But I'm not helping you get revenge."
msgstr "Pero no voy a ayudarte con tu venganza."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "469\t593"
msgid "I've seen enough people walk that path before."
msgstr "Me he visto envuelto en vengazas muchas veces."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "621\t750"
msgid "And I can tell you,\\nno matter how much you want it..."
msgstr "Y puedo decirte que\\nel odio y el resentimiento..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "764\t881"
msgid "Misery's the only thing waiting for you at the end."
msgstr "solo te llevarán a un final triste y miserable."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "947\t1127"
msgid "If you still want to go through with it,\\nI need a good reason."
msgstr "Si todavía insiste en vengarte,\\nnecesito saber el por qué."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1136\t1241"
msgid "Until then, I can't help you."
msgstr "No puedo ayudarte sin saber la situación."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1339\t1438"
msgid "And if I said... I can't tell ya?"
msgstr "¿Y si te dijera que no puedo contarte?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1475\t1531"
msgid "Then I'll stop you."
msgstr "Entonces yo,"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1532\t1585"
msgid "Here and now."
msgstr "te detendré."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1737\t1814"
msgid "I'll take that as a no."
msgstr "Lo tomaré como un NO."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1845\t1902"
msgid "Sorry 'bout this."
msgstr "Lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1921\t2019"
msgid "But I gotta know the truth."
msgstr "Quiero ver con mis ojos si lo que me han dicho es real."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2024\t2109"
msgid "Ain't no one keepin' me from that!"
msgstr "Hasta entonces, ¡no confiaré en nadie!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2115\t2171"
msgid "So that's how it is."
msgstr "Entiendo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2196\t2360"
msgid "You and me, we ain't so different."
msgstr "Tú y yo estamos hechos de la misma madera."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2372\t2457"
msgid "Ya remind me of my sworn brother."
msgstr "Te pareces mucho a mi kyoudai."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2463\t2557"
msgid "You remind me of someone, too."
msgstr "También me recuerdas a alguien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2570\t2628"
msgid "Y'know, I'm relieved."
msgstr "Menos mal."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2629\t2785"
msgid "Up against you, I don't gotta worry\\nabout killin' you by accident."
msgstr "Contra ti, no tengo que preocuparme\\nde matarte por accidente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2804\t2844"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2845\t3021"
msgid "Consider this a test, then.\\nTo see just how bad you want this."
msgstr "Yo también quiero comprobar si vas en serio o no.\\nAdelante, muéstrame."

